{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>The whole commandment which I command you this day you shall observe to do.</b> Now the aim among the multitude is the attainment of temporal successes, which fall into three kinds: length of days, children, and wealth. And through observance of the commandments you will attain all of them; therefore you shall observe to do them." "<b>That you may live.</b> For indeed the blessed El, when He commanded, directed that through observance of His commandments you will attain length of days, even in this transient life." "<b>And you shall increase.</b> That you will attain abundance of children." "<b>And you shall come and inherit.</b> And that you will attain wealth and honor through inheritance of the land."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:20:54.174423196Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}